# BASIC AUTH SYSTEM PLAN

**Status:** Design phase (ready to brief Claude Code)  
**Complexity:** Medium (3-4 hours)  
**Requirement:** Enable multi-user support, per-user OAuth tokens, connection status display, disconnect flow

---

## WHAT WE'RE ADDING

Currently: **Single-user mode** (all data shared, no login)  
After: **Multi-user mode** (each user has own account, own Xero/QB connection)

```
Before:
User visits → No login → Sees invoices/receipts (shared with everyone)

After:
User visits → Login screen → Email + Password
            → Authenticated → See only their documents
            → Connect Xero/QB per user
            → Can disconnect & switch platforms
            → Logout
```

---

## WHY THIS MATTERS

1. **OAuth per user:** Francisco's Xero tokens won't leak to other users
2. **Data privacy:** Each user sees only their documents
3. **Multi-tenant ready:** Can sell to 10, 100, 1000 bookkeepers
4. **Status display works:** "✅ Connected (Account: Francisco's Business)" only for Francisco
5. **Disconnect flow works:** Francisco can switch to QB without affecting other users

