## MINIMAL AUTH SYSTEM (TECH CHOICES)

### **Option 1: Supabase Auth (RECOMMENDED)**
- ✅ Already have Supabase DB
- ✅ Supabase Auth is built-in (managed service)
- ✅ Handles password hashing, sessions, tokens
- ✅ Integration simple (just enable in dashboard)
- ✅ No extra dependencies
- ⏱️ Time: 2-3 hours

### **Option 2: Custom Email/Password + JWT**
- ✅ Full control
- ❌ More code to maintain (password hashing, token refresh, etc.)
- ⏱️ Time: 4-5 hours

**Recommendation:** Use **Supabase Auth (Option 1)** — faster, safer, already in our stack.

