## GO/NO-GO CHECKLIST

### ✅ GO if:
- [ ] Signup creates account + session
- [ ] Login works with correct credentials
- [ ] Wrong credentials rejected
- [ ] Logout clears session
- [ ] Dashboard only shows current user's documents
- [ ] Connection status shows per-user (Francisco sees only his Xero)
- [ ] Disconnect works (clears tokens)
- [ ] Refresh page → still logged in
- [ ] Different browser → shows login (different user)
- [ ] All endpoints protected (require auth)
- [ ] Tests passing (add auth tests)

### ❌ NO-GO if:
- [ ] Data from one user visible to another
- [ ] Session persists after logout
- [ ] Endpoints accessible without login
- [ ] OAuth tokens leak between users

